---
title: Desktop setup · navigation
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    state Connection <<choice>>
    state Result <<choice>>
    state Progress <<choice>>
    state "Not connected" as NotConnected
    state "Hack CLI · required" as Cli
    state "Needs action" as NeedsAction
    state "Couldn’t check" as Unchecked
    state "All done" as Done

    classDef wait stroke-width:1.6px
    class Offline,NotConnected wait
    classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
    class Done ok

    [*] --> Connection
    Connection --> Offline : Connection lost
    Offline --> Connection : Connection returns
    Connection --> NotConnected : CLI missing
    NotConnected --> Welcome : Set up Hack
    Connection --> Welcome : Open setup
    Welcome --> Cli : Start setup
    Cli --> Cli : Install, switch, or retry
    Cli --> Checking : Hack 5 confirmed
    Checking --> Result
    Result --> Passed : Check passed
    Result --> NeedsAction : Fix available
    Result --> Unchecked : Evidence unavailable
    Unchecked --> Checking : Check again
    NeedsAction --> Checking : Recheck or command exit
    NeedsAction --> Progress : Skip this step
    Unchecked --> Progress : Skip this step
    Passed --> Passed : Stay
    Passed --> Progress : Two seconds or Next
    Progress --> Checking : Step remains
    Progress --> Done : No unresolved steps
    Done --> Checking : Reopen or regress
    Done --> [*] : Open Hack
